              "source": "PubMed",
              "id": "11278926"
            }
          ],
          "value": "Inhibited by copper and mercury ions. Also inhibited by thiol active reagents, such as N-ethylmaleimide and hydroxymercuribenzoate. EDTA has a slight activating effect"
        }
      ],
